COMPONENTS
----------

Canvas is assembled from several repositories, all under the same licence and
the same copyright holder. Components marked (submodule) are separate
repositories referenced by this one:

    canvas-server        this repository — server runtime, transports, core
      src/services/embedd    embedding service
      src/services/messaging notification/chat channels
      src/services/voice     speech-to-text / text-to-speech
      src/core/agent         agent runtime

    canvas-synapsd       (submodule) indexing engine
    canvas-stored        (submodule) blob storage
    canvas-neurald       (submodule)
    canvas-web           (submodule) web UI
    canvas-cli           (submodule) command-line client
    canvas-shell         (submodule) shell client
    canvas-fuse          (submodule) FUSE client
    canvas-desktop       (submodule) desktop app
    canvas-browser-extensions (submodule)

Third-party dependencies retain their own licences; see the dependency manifests
and node_modules for their terms. This notice covers only the Canvas code.
